The '''iron door''' is a variant of the [[door]] made of iron that can only be opened using [[redstone]]. Iron doors are more secure than [[Wooden Door|wooden]] and [[copper door]]s because they cannot be opened by hand and cannot be broken by [[zombie]]s. They are also more resistant to explosions, and immune to fire and lava.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
The suitable tool to break iron door is [[pickaxe]].
{{Breaking row
| horizontal = 1
| Iron Door
| Pickaxe
| hideshears = 1
| hidesword = 1
| foot = 1
}}
Iron door drops itself when it's destroyed.

Iron door also drops itself when its supporting block is moved or removed.
=== Natural generation ===
Iron doors generate as part of:

* Prison rooms in [[woodland mansion]]s
* [[Stronghold]]s with two [[stone button]]s to open

=== Crafting ===
