A '''jukebox''' is a [[block]] used to insert and play [[music disc]]s. Playing a disc causes it to produce a [[redstone signal]] and allows nearby [[allay]]s to duplicate when given [[amethyst shard]]s.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
A jukebox can be broken using any [[tool]], but an [[axe]] is the fastest. Jukeboxes also drop all of their contents.
{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Jukebox|Axe|foot=1}}

