'''Hay bales'''{{fn|Also known as '''straw bales''' in [[Language#Differences between English variants|Canadian English]].}} are storage [[block]]s equivalent to nine pieces of [[wheat]]. They are used as a [[crafting]] ingredient, to feed [[llama]]s and all living [[horse]] variants, reduce [[Damage#Fall damage|fall damage]], and extend [[campfire]] smoke.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Hay bales can be [[breaking|mined]] using any [[tool]], but a hoe speeds up the process.

{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Hay Bale|Hoe|Any}}

=== Natural generation ===
Hay bales often generate as [[pile]]s (and in some houses, animal pens, farms, or meeting points) scattered around in [[village]]s located in [[plains]], and less commonly in [[savanna]] and [[desert]] villages. They also can generate under some [[campfire]]s in [[taiga]] villages and as a part of targets/scarecrows in [[pillager outpost]]s.

Hay bales can also generate in [[abandoned camp]]s.

