'''Jungle leaves''' are biome-colored [[leaves]] that form the canopy of [[jungle tree]]s. Their [[Jungle Sapling|sapling]] drop rate is twice as rare as any other leaves.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
[[Hoe]]s are the default tools for breaking leaves, but leaves can be obtained only with [[shears]] or tools [[enchanted]] with [[Silk Touch]].

{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Jungle Leaves|Hoe|drop=0|shears=1|sword=0}}

Without shears, jungle leaves can drop 1 [[jungle sapling]], and 1—2 [[stick]]s. Jungle sapling drops are twice as rare as any other sapling. [[Fortune]] increases the chances.
