=== Natural generation ===
Jungle leaves occur naturally on standing [[jungle tree]]s in [[jungle]] biomes. They also generate as part of [[abandoned camp]]s in bamboo jungles.

{{block distribution}}

=== Post-generation ===
{{see also|Tutorial:Tree farming}}
Jungle leaves generate as part of jungle trees grown from [[jungle sapling]]s.

== Usage ==
{{Main|Leaves#Usage}}
Jungle leaves that decay have the same drop chances as when broken by players, yielding [[jungle sapling]]s 2.5% ({{frac|1|40}}) of the time, [[stick]]s 2% of the time, and otherwise nothing. The jungle sapling drop rate is twice as rare as any other sapling. Leaves that are burned do not yield saplings.

=== Smelting ingredient ===
{{Smelting
