A '''heavy weighted pressure plate''' is a type of [[pressure plate]] that produces a [[redstone]] signal while one or more [[entities]] stand on it. Depending on how many entities are detected, the outputted [[signal strength]] will range from 1 to 15.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
A heavy weighted pressure plate can be mined with anything, but [[pickaxe]]s are the fastest. A heavy weighted pressure plate also breaks and drops itself if a [[piston]] extends or pushes a block into its location, or if the block under the pressure plate is moved or destroyed.
